<p>This is the Black Highlighter theme, a new base theme that aims to be better than the SCP Wiki's default base theme, <a href="/theme:site">Sigma-10</a>. You've already seen it in action.</p>
<p><br /></p>
<h1 id="toc0"><span>Usage</span></h1>
<p>On any wiki:</p>
<div class="code" style="text-align: center;">
<p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;:scp-wiki:theme:black-highlighter-theme]]</span></p>
</div>
